   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Technical Assistance Fund (TAF) is a three-year project; its objective is to provide the Government of Bolivia, under the co-ordination of the Ministry of Finance, with the technical assistance required to: 1)strengthen its fiscal and financial capabilities; 2) improve the management of its public finances; and 3) support the implementation of poverty reduction policies.</narrative>
